message: "If you use this example, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "MPS500 Planning Example: Models, Generated PDDL Descriptions and Plans"
authors:
  - family-names: Nabizada
    given-names: Hamied
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8251-837X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HamiedNabizada/mps500-planning-example"
