abstract: "A SysML model of the Festo MPS500, a training plant with a transfer belt and several processing stations, in 19 configurations and three more for rule coverage. Each configuration is turned into a PDDL description and checked. Requires the repositories pddl-sysml-profile and sysml-pddl-transformation."
keywords:
  - SysML
  - PDDL
  - automated planning
  - manufacturing
